{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G3-01","example":{"issue":{"title":"住宅區無號誌路口的路權、停車及行人穿越問題","intro":"主要道路寬約 15 m、次要道路寬約 8 m，速限均為 30 km/h。周邊以住宅為主，主要道路兩側設有停車格及人行道。","images":[{"key":"results:g3-01-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-01-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-01-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-01-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-01-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"priority","title":"主次道路管制不明確","text":"路口缺少必要的停讓及警示設施，駕駛不易辨識主次道路關係及橫向來車。"},{"id":"space","title":"路側停車與行車空間未明確區分","text":"道路外側設有停車格，但未以路面邊線明確區分停車與行車空間，停放車輛也可能影響駕駛視線。"},{"id":"pedestrian","title":"行人穿越警示不足","text":"住宅區行人穿越需求較高，現況主要依賴行穿線提示，容易受停放車輛遮蔽。"},{"id":"speed","title":"速限提示不足","text":"市區街廓較短，速限標誌與標字配置不足，難以持續提醒駕駛維持低速。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[56,57],"strategy":{"title":"交錯車道、路側停車及低速路口配置","intro":"配合住宅區 30 km/h 速限及停車需求，透過車道橫移與停車格交錯配置，使車輛減速接近無號誌路口。","images":[{"key":"results:g3-01-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"offset","title":"利用車道橫移降低車速","text":"於路口前後採交錯車道配置，使車輛通過路口時須配合道路線形調整行駛方向，促使駕駛減速。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"parking","title":"配合車道橫移交錯設置停車格","text":"沿道路兩側交替配置單邊停車格，利用路側停車空間形成車道橫移，並區分停車與行車範圍。","moduleId":"M1-03"},{"id":"guidance","title":"以路口行車導引線銜接前後車道","text":"配合車道橫移位置劃設路口行車導引線，引導車輛沿主要道路通過交叉口。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"warning","title":"補充慢行及行人穿越提示","text":"於主要道路設置慢行標誌及 30 km/h 速限提示，並配合行人穿越道提醒駕駛注意穿越行人。","moduleId":"M4-01"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-3-01-unsignalized-urban-orthogonal-cross.typ","sha256":"eea5b0d69bef27202fc63448a5a043d9901454245292c451f0aa44db696136b4","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g3-01-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-01/G3-01_現況圖_01.png","width":3479,"height":2300,"label":"G3-01 現況圖","scenario":"G3-01","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":56,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image52.png","sha256":"bd9a78c7f084656db56c7069f6703df825735e3b9deecbe773d7aac6e5aca1ae"},"results:g3-01-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-01/G3-01_現況照片_01.png","width":2526,"height":1386,"label":"G3-01 現況照片","scenario":"G3-01","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":57,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image54.png","sha256":"469129ec275d0510b2034a090f857726769afbd1a790374a4e0ad7647d0086e5"},"results:g3-01-photo-2":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-01/G3-01_現況照片_02.png","width":2570,"height":1402,"label":"G3-01 現況照片 2","scenario":"G3-01","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":57,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image55.png","sha256":"2f104b7b26b3bed6ddbef1680a71080a88c14e7ba15ea10fc16f619dcf42a516"},"results:g3-01-photo-3":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-01/G3-01_現況照片_03.png","width":2607,"height":1387,"label":"G3-01 現況照片 3","scenario":"G3-01","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":57,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image56.png","sha256":"25b51b27193ff8238cfe24a4ebc2a29127c4442a7b88650059160b5caa452a90"},"results:g3-01-photo-4":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-01/G3-01_現況照片_04.png","width":2594,"height":1425,"label":"G3-01 現況照片 4","scenario":"G3-01","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":57,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image53.png","sha256":"e338b3022c889e97a42221d9938bc0edd9d18f0ea395989a93fc12f1f0a83f5d"},"results:g3-01-strategy":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/G3-01/G3-01_無號誌市區正交四叉路口交通設施整體設置圖例.svg","width":1264,"height":787,"label":"G3-01 整體佈設圖","scenario":"G3-01","role":"strategy","sha256":"4d8d5353facddc4d4c54fb85cb8816fa173e7dc3b523c17b1dadbb6719fb42e1"}}}
